D - MOVE RIGHT
S - MOVE BACK
ARROW KEYS - MOVE CAMERA
CTRL - MOVE DOWN
SPACE - MOVE UP
LEFT MOUSE - SELECT BOX
ENTER - CONFIRM SELECTION
TAB - RELEASE CURSOR
X - TOGGLE POSSIBLE PLAYS
C - CYCLE NEXT PLAY
Z - CYCLE LAST PLAY
Q - TELEPORT TO SELECTED OR FORWARD
ESC - OPEN MENU"

